  "analytic_statement": "For every n>=5,T=2^(n-4), actual positive generic weights with w0>w1 and admissible paired ranks have R=21T/2,U=13T/2, so (2U-1)-R=5T/2-1=(5/32)2^n-1. At n4 the seed has R10,U6 and deficit1.",
